[00:23.76]
[00:23.76]That snowflake once fell on my nose
[00:28.71]那片雪花曾落在我的鼻尖
[00:28.71]Now flying backwards to last winter
[00:35.02]现在正倒飞回往年冬天
[00:35.02]I realize that hellos are goodbyes
[00:39.89]我意识到，问候即告别
[00:39.89]The moment I softly let go of your hand
[00:46.50]当我轻轻松开你的手
[00:46.50]Winds hum through the trembling branches
[00:51.39]风在颤抖的枝桠间呼啸而过
[00:51.39]A song for a soul bound to soar to
[00:55.04]唱着一首歌
[00:55.04]The very edge of the starry ocean
[00:57.92]献给注定飞往星海尽头的灵魂
[00:57.92]Even if we're meant to fall apart
[01:02.81]即便我们注定分道扬镳
[01:02.81]I will gaze at where you are for all time
[01:08.04]在所有的时间里，我都会朝着你的方向凝望
[01:08.04]Bon voyage
[01:10.79]旅途愉快
[01:10.79]May your path be clear
[01:13.60]愿你的道路清晰无阻
[01:13.60]May you get to where dreams are all crystalline and sweet
[01:20.81]愿你抵达之处，美梦都晶莹甜美
[01:20.81]Please crack a little smile
[01:25.06]笑一笑吧
[01:25.06]You won't be alone
[01:27.60]你不会孤单
[01:27.60]In this world you've chosen as your own
[01:32.25]在你选择的世界里 你不会孤单
[01:32.25]Don't worry
[01:34.25]别担心
[01:34.25]I'm well aware that all snowflakes melt in the end
[01:43.61]我深知所有雪花最终都会融化
[01:43.61]Which is sign of warmth and hope of spring
[01:48.63]这也是开春温暖与希望的信号
[01:48.63]So I'll dance flamboyantly into that good night
[02:05.06]所以我将明艳地舞进那良夜
[02:05.06]Bon voyage
[02:07.93]旅途愉快
[02:07.93]May your path be clear
[02:10.75]愿你的道路清晰无阻
[02:10.75]May you get to where dreams are all crystalline and sweet
[02:17.94]愿你抵达之处，美梦都晶莹甜美
[02:17.94]Please crack a little smile
[02:22.18]笑一笑吧
[02:22.18]You won't be alone
[02:24.74]你不会孤单
[02:24.74]In this world you've chosen as your own
[02:29.46]在你选择的世界里 你不会孤单
[02:29.46]Timing is such a dazzling riddle
[02:35.06]时间是个如此令人眼花缭乱的谜题
[02:35.06]Guess I'll spend my whole life unraveling it
[02:40.80]看来我得用一生来解开它了
[02:40.80]Though it might cost me everything I have
[02:46.52]尽管这可能会让我付出拥有的一切
[02:46.52]I never regret it wouldn't have it any other way cuz
[02:52.33]我心已决，这就是我想要的注定
[02:52.33]Those who trace starlight on their lonely roads
[02:57.90]因为那些在孤独道路上追寻星光的人
[02:57.90]Will find their destinations in the cosmos
[03:03.65]终将在宇宙中寻找到他们的归处
[03:03.65]Meeting you in that swirling snowfall's
